<title>SWEDEN: Perstorp posts fall in 1995/96 profit.</title>
<headline>Perstorp posts fall in 1995/96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish chemicals and plastics firm Perstorp AB on Friday posted its results for the 12 months to August 31, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				716 vs 745</p>
<p> Operating income			 12,928 vs 13,004</p>
<p> Operating costs			  11,439 vs 11,562</p>
<p> Depreciation				  622 vs    570</p>
<p> Operating profit after deprec	   867 vs    872</p>
<p> Financial income			     42 vs     49</p>
<p> Financial costs			     193 vs    176</p>
<p> Minorities					8 vs	6</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)				 6.27 vs   6.98</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns)	     2.50 vs   2.33</p>
<p>NOTE -- Perstorp AB is a chemicals and plastics firm.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
